// Package envcontract carries the report-only guard for the frozen
// environment-variable / configuration.json contract.
//
// The artifacts live outside the Go module, in go_hive/contracts/*.json, and
// are generated by go_hive/scripts/freeze_env_config_contract.py. This package
// deliberately contains no production code: it only makes the frozen counts
// visible in `go test ./...` so a drifting manifest is noticed during normal
// CI runs without blocking unrelated work.
package envcontract
